-- 600 + 900 = 1500 against the greater of 1000 and 1200: reduced by 300.
#ASSERT `By how much is my other weekly compensation reduced` 600 900 1000 1200 EQUALS 300
#ASSERT `By how much is my other weekly compensation reduced` 300 900 1000 1200 EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `By how much is my other weekly compensation reduced` 301 900 1000 1200 EQUALS 1
#ASSERT `By how much is my other weekly compensation reduced` 100 200 1000 1200 EQUALS 0
-- 2000 + 100 = 2100 against 1000: the difference 1100 is more than the 100 to be reduced (fork F4).
#ASSERT `By how much is my other weekly compensation reduced` 2000 100 1000 500 EQUALS 100

